  "details": "Sharing a PC is a hassle because logging out from steam account doesn't log out the VRChat account. (Not tested with steam account login).\nI don't mind it remembering credentials. It's just so that you wouldnt have to open vrchat, log out from a siblings account, and then log in on yours.\nI would prefer if it remembered which account that account was logged on.\n\nSorry for a messy post.\nThank you for taking your time to read :)",
